    <AttributeType Name="pitch" ID="85564f46-2a02-4fcf-8a6f-544aa40d8e42" AttributeDataType="xs:string" RefAttributeType="AutomationML_BasicProperties.Geometry_AttributeTypeLib/planeAngle">
      <Description>The angular rotation of an object around its lateral (side-to-side) axis, resulting in a forward or backward tilt relative to a reference plane, usually horizontal.</Description>
