  <AttributeTypeLib Name="AutomationML_BasicProperties.CommercialProperties_AttributeTypeLib" ID="c7be1052-6e82-4fc9-ad44-fb7a10692bd7">
    <Description>
This AttributeTypeLib defines fundamental, domain-neutral commercial attributes used to identify and reference commercial and procurement-related aspects of an asset.
The contained attributes describe factual commercial information such as prices, currencies, contractual references, and procurement identifiers without implying accounting rules, valuation logic, or organizational processes.
All attributes are formulated independent of a specific industry, enterprise structure, financial system, or business workflow and serve as optional reference information across the asset lifecycle.
  </Description>
    <Version>1.2.1</Version>
    <AttributeType Name="price" AttributeDataType="xs:double" Unit="" ID="b3a6a1d2-8c41-4e9a-bf47-6b1f4b3a9f01">
      <Description>Monetary amount representing a price value without specifying price type, valuation method, or commercial context. The interpretation of this value requires an associated currency and, if applicable, a validity reference.
  </Description>
      <Version>1.2.1</Version>
    </AttributeType>
    <AttributeType Name="purchasePrice" AttributeDataType="xs:double" ID="b9e09ee9-61b6-442d-b6e8-fd006e3cfc30" RefAttributeType="AutomationML_BasicProperties.CommercialProperties_AttributeTypeLib/price">
      <Description>Price paid for acquiring the asset as a stated monetary amount.</Description>
      <Version>1.2.1</Version>
      <RefSemantic CorrespondingAttributePath="0173-1#02-AAQ214#003" />
    </AttributeType>
    <AttributeType Name="listPrice" AttributeDataType="xs:double" ID="aef03a10-ceba-4048-ac93-1bae113a198f" RefAttributeType="AutomationML_BasicProperties.CommercialProperties_AttributeTypeLib/price">
      <Description>List or catalogue price of the asset as stated by the manufacturer or supplier.</Description>
      <Version>1.2.1</Version>
      <RefSemantic CorrespondingAttributePath="0173-1#02-AAO739#003" />
    </AttributeType>
    <AttributeType Name="priceCurrency" AttributeDataType="xs:string" ID="f4d6a90c-9e9b-4b6e-bfa6-8c7e3a9f1d22">
      <Description>Currency code in which the associated price value is expressed.
  </Description>
      <Version>1.2.1</Version>
    </AttributeType>
    <AttributeType Name="priceDate" AttributeDataType="xs:date" ID="068604f5-a108-4de5-9fc9-00ba5f7f3047" RefAttributeType="AutomationML_BasicProperties.Time_AttributeTypeLib/date">
      <Description>Date at which the referenced price information was valid.</Description>
